Sources
-------
- 33333s/u60pro-devui (MIT): https://github.com/33333s/u60pro-devui
  The current touch UI is a Rust + LVGL rewrite and no longer contains its
  C code.
- Later changes by Wei REN: the Rust + LVGL rewrite (luyaz-ui), eSIM
  switching page, Tailscale card.

This repository starts from a cleaned snapshot of that work, not from its git
history. Not published:
- third_party/lvgl/ (clone LVGL v9.5.0 yourself; the Makefile tells you how)
- ubus_list.txt (runtime dump of a real device)
- scripts/remote-build.sh (tied to a private build machine)
- CHANGELOG.md and development notes of the older litehtml renderer
  (docs/UI-GUIDE.md, SIGNAL-CARDS.md, DEVUI-IPC.md, modem.md, REPO_BOUNDARY.md)
Private host names in comments and docs were replaced with placeholders.

Third-party components
----------------------
- third_party/stb/: public domain / MIT (see the file headers).
- Build-time dependencies, not included: LVGL v9.5.0 (MIT, with the small
  patch in patches/), FreeType (FreeType License or GPLv2), and for the
  legacy renderer litehtml (BSD-3-Clause). A statically linked binary carries
  their code; ship their license texts with any binary you distribute.
- No ZTE fonts or vendor binaries are included. docs/images/ are rendered by
  the offscreen render test from made-up test data.

